  "N12" [label="(13,0,0) The overall final size limit in DNA origami design is determined by the scaffold strand (M13mp18 genome: 7249 bases)"];
  "N15" [label="(0,0,0) If a technology has fundamental size constraints, then strategies to overcome these constraints must be developed"];
  "N24" [label="(20,0,0) Unscaffolded nanostructures employing SST assembly require every ssDNA tile to be designed and synthesized individually"];
  "N27" [label="(0,0,0) Methods requiring many unique components face scalability and cost challenges"];
